# Responsive layout (portfolio)

Breakpoints (see `js/config.js` → `BREAKPOINTS`):
- **719px** — maze compact / drawer chrome
- **720px+** — desktop maze; mission banner centered
- **1280px+** — sidebar rail + narrower mission pill

## Quest mission (`#quest-banner`)

- In **maze mode** on **≥720px**: centered pill (`margin-inline: auto`, `width: fit-content`, `text-align: center`).
- Mobile **≤719px**: full-width bar, ellipsis OK.
- Never use `position: fixed` + off-center transforms in maze top-bar context.
- Korean copy: inherit `:lang(ko) { word-break: keep-all }`.

## Top bar (desktop maze)

- Row grid: `1fr auto 1fr` — brand left, **status centered**, tools right.
- `max-width: min(72rem, 100%)` on the row for ultra-wide screens.

## Verification

```zsh
cd portfolio && npm run lint:layout && npm run test:layout
```
